  "question": {
    "text": "If a chord, which is not a tangent, of the parabola <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>x</mi></math> has the equation <math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>p</mi></math>, and midpoint (h, k), then which of the following is (are) possible value(s) of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi></math> and <math><mi>k</mi></math>?<br />&nbsp;"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi> </mi><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Equation of chord with mid point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>)</mo></math>:</p><p><math><mi>k</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>16</mn><mi>h</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>&#160;</mi></math></p><p>Comparing with&nbsp; <math><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> we get</p><p><math><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Only <math><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math> satisfies above relation.</p>"
  }
